text = "CloseB$ is the rebranding of the company open4all.
It is specialized in e-helpers, e-workers and has been expanding its e-centers to power it all.
The goal of the organization is to help companies save money on salaries by reducing their workforce, help them solve inhumane tasks and increase their capital.

It is now promoting its new e-worker quickly being adopted by large companies."
